63_4p0503"><label>15</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Milani</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name><name><surname>Amado-Jo&#x000e3;o</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Farah</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fundamentos da Fisioterapia dermato-funcional: revis&#x000e3;o de literatura</article-title><source>Fisioterapia e Pesquisa</source><year>2006</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>37</fpage><lpage>43</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="b16-cln63_4p0503"><label>16</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Craig</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Marshall</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name><name><surname>Sj&#x000f6;strom</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bauman</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name><name><surname>Booth</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Ainsworth</surname><given-names>BE</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>International physical activity questionnaire: 12-contry reliability and validity</article-title><source>Med Sci Sports Exerc</source><year>2003</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>1381</fpage><lpage>95</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12900694</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b17-cln63_4p0503"><label>17</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Adaptive significance of female physical attractiveness: role of waist-to-hip ratio</article-title><source>J Pers Soc Psychol</source><year>1993</year><volume>65</volume><fpage>295</fpage><lpage>307</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="b18-cln63_4p0503"><label>18</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group pe